    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but my doctor is totally unreachable until monday and i feel like crap right now. it's just a standard single dose of the cold medicine, not like a huge amount. is there actually any documented danger with combining them, or is it just one of those \"better safe than sorry\" things doctors say? like is there a real clinical risk or is it just something to keep an eye on?",
